# Case flow

Work inside a claim moves in order, like a tax interview. A step opens on the first part that is not filled in. Continue moves to the next open part. A finished run opens on its last open part.

When a plan or a change needs to decide what "filled in" means, and the screen does not already mark that part done, ask before implementing. Do not invent a second definition of finished.
